# Architecture

This is a static Vite + React game deployed to GitHub Pages.

- Change gameplay only in `src/engine/` (`physiology.ts`, `schedule.ts`, `reducer.ts`, `wheel.ts`, `copy.ts`).
- React components dispatch existing actions and render `GameState`. Do not embed urine/hold/reward logic in JSX.
- Add shadcn pieces with `npx shadcn@latest add`. Leave `src/components/ui/` as generated.
- Keep the production build a static `dist/` (no server). Vite `base` is `./` so GitHub project Pages works.
